    "successful_non_mutations": {
      "POST /api/agents/{id}/memory/search":"query endpoint; a successful call is read-only"
    },
    "expansion": "For every path×method in baseline/l1/opencrab-l1.json, capture a normal/local-precondition probe and an input-rejection or resource-absence probe. Normal branches that require an external credential, live service, LLM, or operator workspace are emitted as uncollected L3 entries.",
    "why": [
      "A replacement must not silently drop an HTTP method that remains present in the L1 route inventory.",
      "Malformed JSON and missing-resource behavior are consumed by the dashboard and integrations, not just happy-path payloads.",
      "Fresh seeded state per probe prevents ordering from becoming part of the contract."
    ]
  },
